    "Second Ziyarat (by Imam Ali al-Naqi)\nShaykh al-Kulayni reports Imam `Ali al-Naqi (al-Hadi) to have said:\nWhen you are at al-Husayn’s tomb, you should say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ ٱللَّهِ فِي أَرْضِهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE FEE ARZEHI\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s Argument in His lands\nوَشَاهِدَهُ عَلَىٰ خَلْقِهِ\nWA SHAAHEDAHU A’LAA KHALQEHI\nand His witness on His creatures.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ عَليٍّ ٱلْمُرْتَضَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA A’LIYYENIL MURTAZAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of `Ali the well-pleased.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ فَاطِمَةَ ٱلزَّهْرَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatimah the Luminous.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ قَدْ أَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ وَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA WA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers, defrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE WA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nenjoined the right, forbade the wrong,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ حَتَّىٰ أَتَاكَ ٱلْيَقِينُ\nWA JAAHADTA FEE SABEELIL LAAHE HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nand strove for Allah’s sake until death came upon you.\nفَصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكَ حَيّاً وَمَيِّتاً\nFASALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA HAYYANW WA MAYYETAN\nSo, Allah may bless you in your lifetime and after your death.\nYou may then stick your right cheek to the tomb and say these words:\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ عَلَىٰ بَيِّنَةٍ مِنْ رَبِّكَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA A’LAA BAYYENATIM MIR RABBEKA\nI bear witness that you are verily relying on clear proof from your Lord.\nجِئْتُ مُقِرّاً بِٱلذُّنُوبِ\nJEATO MOQIRRAN BIZ-ZONOOBE\nI have come confessing of my sins\nلِتَشْفَعَ لِي عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ\nLE-TASHFA-A’ LEE I’NDA RABBEKA\nso that you may intercede for me before your Lord.\nيَا بْنَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nYABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nO son of Allah’s Messenger.\nYou should then mention the Holy Imams by names respectively and then say the following words:\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكُمْ حُجَجُ ٱللَّهِ\nASH-HADO ANNAKUM HOJAJUL LAAHE\nI bear witness that you are verily Allah’s Arguments (against His creatures).\nأُكْتُبْ لِي عِنْدَكَ مِيثَاقاً وَعَهْداً\nUKTUB LEE I’NDAKA MEESAAQANW WA A’HDAN\nPlease, write down for me a covenant and a pledge with you.\nإِنِّي أَتَيْتُكَ مُجَدِّداً ٱلْمِيثَاقَ\nINNEE ATAYTOKA MOJADDEDANIL MEESAAQA\nI have come to you to refresh my covenant;\nفَٱشْهَدْ لِي عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ\nFASHHAD LEE I’NDA RABBEKA\nso, testify this to me before your Lord.\nإِنَّكَ أَنْتَ ٱلشَاهِدُ\nINNAKA ANTASH SHAAHEDO\nYou are verily the Witness.",
    "Third Ziyarat (by Imam Ja’far al-Sadiq)\nWhen you arrive at the tomb of al-Husayn ibn `Ali (`a), stop at the gate and say:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ آدَمَ صَفْوَةِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA AADAMA SAFWATIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Adam the chosen by Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ نُوحٍ نَبِيِّ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA NOOHIN NABIYYIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Noah the prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ إِبْرَاهِيمَ خَلِيلِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA IBRAAHEEMA KHALEELIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Abraham the friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوسَىٰ كَلِيمِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA MOOSAA KALEEMIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Moses the spoken by Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عِيسَىٰ رُوحِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA E’ESAA ROOHIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Jesus the spirit of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ رُسُلِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA MOHAMMADIN SAYYEDE ROSOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Muhammad the chief of Allah’s Messengers.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عَليٍّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA A’LIYYIN\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of `Ali\nأَمِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَخَيْرِ ٱلْوَصِيِّينَ\nAMEERIL MOAMENEENA WA KHAYRIL WASIYYEENA\nthe commander of the faithful and the best of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ ٱلْحَسَنِ ٱلرَّضِيِّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESAL HASANIR RAZIYYE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of al-Hasan the amicable,\nٱلطَّاهِرِ ٱلرَّاضِي ٱلْمَرْضِيِّ\nATTAAHERIR RAAZIL MARZIYYE\nthe immaculate, the content, and the pleased.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْوَصِيُّ ٱلْبَرُّ ٱلتَّقِيُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL WASIYYUL BARRUT TAQIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O dutiful and pious successor.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ ٱلأَرْوَاحِ ٱلَّتِي حَلَّتْ بِفِنَائِكَ وَأَنَاخَتْ بِرَحْلِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAL ARWAAHIL LATEE HALLAT BE-FENAAA-EKA WA ANAAKHAT BE-RAHLEKA\nPeace be upon you and upon these souls who gathered before your yard and resided next to your residence.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ ٱلْمَلاَئِكَةِ ٱلْحَافِّينَ بِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAL MALAAA-EKATIL HAAFFEENA BEKA\nPeace be upon you and upon the angels who are encompassing you.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ قَدْ أَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ وَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA WA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers, defrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE WA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nenjoined the right, forbade the wrong,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ ٱلْمُلْحِدينَ وَعَبَدْتَ ٱللَّهَ حَتَّىٰ أَتَاكَ ٱلْيَقِينُ\nWA JAAHADTAL MULHEDEENA WA A’BADTAL LAAHA HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nstrove against the atheists, and served Allah until death came upon you.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nYou may then walk towards the tomb. With each step you make, you will be awarded the reward of one who sacrifices his blood for the sake of Allah. When you approach the tomb, you may wipe your hand over it and say these words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ ٱللَّهِ فِي سمائه وأرضه\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE FEE SAMAAA-EHI WA ARZEHI\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s Argument in His lands.\nYou may then go for offering the prayer. For each unit of prayer that you offer near the tomb, you will have the reward of one who went one thousand times on hajj and one thousand times on `umrah, manumitted one thousand slaves for the sake of Allah, and stood in the line of a missioned Prophet one thousand times.”",
    "Fourth Ziyarat\nMu`awiyah ibn `Ammar has reported that he asked Imam al-Sadiq ('a) what to do when visiting Imam al-Husayn’s tomb. The Imam ('a) taught him to say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nMay Allah bless you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nرَحِمَكَ ٱللَّهُ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nRAHEMAKAL LAAHO YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nMay Allah have mercy upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ قَتَلَكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN QATALAKA\nMay Allah curse those who slew you.\nوَلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ شَرِكَ فِي دَمِكَ\nWA LA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN SHAREKA FEE DAMEKA\nMay Allah curse those who took part in shedding your blood.\nوَلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ بَلَغَهُ ذٰلِكَ فَرَضِيَ بِهِ\nWA LA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN BALAGHAHU ZAALEKA FARAZEYA BEHI\nMay Allah curse those who are pleased when they knew about it.\nأَنَا إِلَىٰ ٱللَّهِ مَنْ ذٰلِكَ بَريءٌ\nANAA ELAL LAAHE MIN ZAALEKA BAREE-UN\nI disavow all those in the presence of Allah.",
    "Fifth Ziyarat\nFrom a valid chain of authority, Imam al-Kazim ('a) is reported to have asked Ibrahim ibn Abi’l-Ballad, “What do you say when you visit al-Husayn The man answered: I say the following\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ قَدْ أَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers,\nوَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE\nenjoining the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the evil,\nوَدَعَوْتَ إِلَىٰ سَبِيلِ رَبِّكَ\nWA DA-A’WTA ELAA SABEELE RABBEKA\nand called to the way of your Lord\nبِٱلْحِكْمَةِ وَٱلْمَوْعِظَةِ ٱلْحَسَنَةِ\nBIL-HIKMATE WAL MAW-E’ZATIL HASANATE\nwith wisdom and excellent exhortation.\nوَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ سَفَكُوٱ دَمَكَ وَٱسْتَحَلُّوٱ حُرْمَتَكَ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAL LAZEENA SAFAKO DAMAKA WAS TAHALLO HURMATAKA\nI also bear witness that those who shed your blood and violated your sanctity\nمَلْعُونُونَ مُعَذَّبُونَ عَلَىٰ لِسَانِ دَاوُدَ وَعيسَىٰ بْنِ مَرْيَمَ\nMAL-O’ONOONA MO-A’ZZABOONA A’LAA LESAANE DAAWODA WA E’ESABNE MARYAMA\nhave been accursed, and will be tortured, by the tongue of David and Jesus the son of Mary.\nذٰلِكَ بِمَا عَصَوْٱ وَكَانُوٱ يَعْتَدُونَ\nZAALEKA BEMAA A’SAW WA KAANOO YA’TADOONA\nThis was because they disobeyed and used to exceed the limit.\nThe Imam ('a) commented, “Yes, this is accurate.” بحار الأنوار: ج101، ص165\nBihar al-Anwar: vol. 101, p. 165.",
    "Sixth Ziyarat\n`Ammar has reported Imam al-Sadiq ('a) as saying that when you stop at the grave of Imam al-Husayn ('a), you may say the following words\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ أَمِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the commander of the faithful.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَ شَبَابِ أَهْلِ ٱلْجَنَّةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAYYEDA SHABAABE AHLIL JANNATE\nPeace be upon you, O chief of the youth of Paradise.\nوَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ رِضَاهُ مِنْ رِضَا ٱلرَّحْمٰنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAR REZAAHO MIR REZAR RAHMAANE\nPeace be upon you, O he whose pleasure is part of the pleasure of the All-beneficent Lord\nوَسَخَطُهُ مِنْ سَخَطِ ٱلرَّحْمٰنِ\nWA SAKHATOHU MIN SAKHATIR RAHMAANE\nand whose displeasure is part of the displeasure of the All-beneficent Lord.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَمِينَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEENAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O trustee of Allah,\nوَحُجَّةَ ٱللَّهِ وَبَابَ ٱللَّهِ\nWA HUJJATAL LAAHE WA BAABAL LAAHE\nArgument of Allah, door to Allah,\nوَٱلدَّلِيلَ عَلَىٰ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلدَاعِيَ إِلَىٰ ٱللَّهِ\nWAD DALEELA A’LAL LAAHE WAD DAA-E’YA ELAL LAAHE\nguide to Allah, and caller to Allah.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ قَدْ حَلَّلْتَ حَلاَلَ ٱللَّهِ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD HALLALTA HALAALAL LAAHE\nI bear witness that you deemed lawful all that which Allah has deemed lawful,\nوَحَرَّمْتَ حَرَامَ ٱللَّهِ\nWA HARRAMTA HARAAMAL LAAHE\ndeemed unlawful all that which Allah has deemed unlawful,\nوَأَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ\nWA AQAMTAS SALAATA\nperformed the prayers,\nوَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْروُفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the evil,\nوَدَعَوْتَ إِلَىٰ سَبِيلِ رَبِّكَ\nWA DA-A’WTA ELAA SABEELE RABBEKA\nand called to the way of your Lord\nبِٱلْحِكْمَةِ وَٱلْمَوْعِظَةِ ٱلْحَسَنَةِ\nBIL-HIKMATE WAL MAW-E’ZATIL HASANATE\nwith wisdom and excellent exhortation.\nوَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ وَمَنْ قُتِلَ مَعَكَ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA WA MAN QOTELA MA-A’KA\nI also bear witness that you, as well as those whom were slain with you,\nشُهَدَاءٌ أَحْيَاءٌ عِنْدَ رَبِّكُمْ تُرْزَقُونَ\nSHOHADAAA-UN AHYAAA-UN I’NDA RABBEKUM TURZAQOONA\nare martyrs, alive, and provided sustenance from your Lord.\nوَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ قَاتِلَكَ فِي ٱلنَّارِ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNA QAATELAKA FIN NAARE\nI also bear witness that your slayer shall be in Hellfire.\nأَدِينُ ٱللَّهَ بِٱلْبَرَاءَةِ مِمَّنْ قَتَلَكَ\nADEENUL LAAHA BIL-BARAAA-ATE MIMMAN QATALAKA\nBefore Allah, I profess disavowal of those who slew you,\nوَمِمَّنْ قَاتَلَكَ وَشَايَعَ عَلَيْكَ\nWA MIMMAN QAATALAKA WA SHAAYA-A’ A’LAYKA\nwho fought against you, who supported each other against you,\nوَمِمَّنْ جَمَعَ عَلَيْكَ\nWA MIMMAN JAMA-A’ A’LAYKA\nwho rallied against you,\nوَمِمَّنْ سَمِعَ صَوْتَكَ وَلَمْ يُعِنْكَ\nWA MIMMAN SAME-A’ SAWTAKA WA LAM YO-I’NKA\nand who heard your call but refrained from helping you.\nيَا لَيْتَنِي كُنْتُ مَعَكُمْ فَأَفُوزَ فَوْزاً عَظيماً\nYAA LAYTANEE KUNTO MA-A’KUM FA-AFOOZA FAWZAN A’ZEEMAN\nWould that I were with you, then should I achieve a great success."
